# L §5.5 Fan-out (tally 2.1.7 R8, issue #147; #122a, P47): a diff whose expression reads an axis is evaluated in
# every combination; its result is its set of added, removed and changed lines, and the combinations with equal
# lines print as one line under one head (`[ax = lo | mid]`, or `[ax = *]` when every option gives it), each with
# its own register (F10: twice is held only where hi reads it). A diff that reads no axis prints no head; a pinned
# one prints the pinned world; a diff across two stacks (s, t) fans out the same way. 2.1.6's refcore compared
# both worlds outside the fan-out and printed 0 changed under one head.
=== g.tally
model g
  tally 2
  on 2026-03-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "made up"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

axis ax
  lo "low"
  mid "middle"
  hi "high"

input p: money PLN

input twice: int

input asked_on: date

def f: money PLN at asked_on
  rule base = p
  rule hi beats base = p * twice when ax == hi

def plain: money PLN = p at asked_on

def same: money PLN at asked_on
  rule base = p
  rule hi beats base = p when ax == hi

ask d_f: diff(f) in s against g

ask d_plain: diff(plain) in s against g

ask d_pin: diff(f) in s against g with ax = hi

ask d_same: diff(same) in s against g

ask d_stacks: diff(f) in s against t

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  p = 10.00 PLN "the card"
  twice = 2 "the card"
  asked_on = 2026-06-01 "the card"
=== g_s.tally
scenario s over g
  tally 2
  from 2026-01-01

version cheaper
  cite s
  governs 2026-01-01..
  known 2026-01-01
  replace p = 4.00 PLN "a cheaper card"
=== g_t.tally
scenario t over g
  tally 2
  from 2026-01-01

version dearer
  cite s
  governs 2026-01-01..
  known 2026-01-01
  replace twice = 3 "a dearer rule"
=== expect
d_f [ax = lo | mid]: diff in s against g: 1 changed, 0 added, 0 removed, 0 unchanged
  changed f: 4.00 PLN against 10.00 PLN
  world: g
  world: s
  reading: ax = lo | mid
  held: p = 4.00 PLN (cheaper), read for 2026-06-01
  cut 2026-03-01
d_f [ax = hi]: diff in s against g: 1 changed, 0 added, 0 removed, 0 unchanged
  changed f: 8.00 PLN against 20.00 PLN
  world: g
  world: s
  reading: ax = hi
  held: p = 4.00 PLN (cheaper), read for 2026-06-01
  cut 2026-03-01
d_pin: diff in s against g: 1 changed, 0 added, 0 removed, 0 unchanged
  changed f: 8.00 PLN against 20.00 PLN
  pinned: ax = hi
  world: g
  world: s
  held: p = 4.00 PLN (cheaper), read for 2026-06-01
  cut 2026-03-01
d_plain: diff in s against g: 1 changed, 0 added, 0 removed, 0 unchanged
  changed plain: 4.00 PLN against 10.00 PLN
  world: g
  world: s
  held: p = 4.00 PLN (cheaper), read for 2026-06-01
  cut 2026-03-01
d_same [ax = *]: diff in s against g: 1 changed, 0 added, 0 removed, 0 unchanged
  changed same: 4.00 PLN against 10.00 PLN
  world: g
  world: s
  held: p = 4.00 PLN (cheaper), read for 2026-06-01
  cut 2026-03-01
d_stacks [ax = lo | mid]: diff in s against t: 1 changed, 0 added, 0 removed, 0 unchanged
  changed f: 4.00 PLN against 10.00 PLN
  world: s
  world: t
  reading: ax = lo | mid
  held: p = 4.00 PLN (cheaper), read for 2026-06-01
  cut 2026-03-01
d_stacks [ax = hi]: diff in s against t: 1 changed, 0 added, 0 removed, 0 unchanged
  changed f: 8.00 PLN against 30.00 PLN
  world: s
  world: t
  reading: ax = hi
  held: p = 4.00 PLN (cheaper), read for 2026-06-01
  held: twice = 3 (dearer), read for 2026-06-01
  cut 2026-03-01
